WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
"Echo Of A Letter" (Episode 10)

3
00:25.199 --> 00:26.240
Mr. Zhao! Mr. Zhao!

4
00:26.320 --> 00:26.959
No, no, no.

5
00:27.039 --> 00:28.136
President Zhao, President Zhao!

6
00:28.160 --> 00:28.799
It's all my fault.

7
00:28.879 --> 00:29.879
Sorry for the scare.

8
00:33.679 --> 00:34.679
Careful.

9
00:36.600 --> 00:37.039
I'm fine.

10
00:37.119 --> 00:38.039
Chen Wan, I'm fine.

11
00:38.119 --> 00:39.119
It's okay now.

12
00:40.520 --> 00:41.319
Calm down.

13
00:41.399 --> 00:42.399
It's all over.

14
00:44.880 --> 00:45.880
I'm okay.

15
00:48.679 --> 00:49.679
Breathe.

16
00:55.520 --> 00:56.936
Thankfully, it's just a flesh wound.

17
00:56.960 --> 00:58.320
Get some rest, Mr. Zhao.

18
01:09.760 --> 01:10.760
Zhao Shengge.

19
01:12.680 --> 01:13.680
What is it?

20
01:14.480 --> 01:15.896
Are you still willing to talk to me?

21
01:15.920 --> 01:16.920
Chen Wan.

22
01:18.079 --> 01:20.560
I, Zhao Shengge, am always a man of my word.

23
01:22.400 --> 01:23.400
All right.

24
01:24.959 --> 01:26.040
I'll head back then.

25
01:31.000 --> 01:32.760
You feel wronged, don't you?

26
01:32.840 --> 01:34.239
No.

27
01:34.319 --> 01:35.799
I just think—.

28
01:37.599 --> 01:38.599
I don't feel wronged.

29
01:39.319 --> 01:40.319
Chen Wan.

30
01:41.239 --> 01:42.799
Do you think you did anything wrong?

31
01:44.239 --> 01:45.319
Yes, I did.

32
01:46.799 --> 01:47.919
I doubt you really think so.

33
01:49.920 --> 01:51.359
Aren't you wondering

34
01:51.439 --> 01:54.159
how, after your foolproof, airtight plan,

35
01:54.239 --> 01:55.799
I still managed to get out?

36
01:56.319 --> 02:00.120
You're probably thinking about how to be even more thorough next time, right?

37
02:01.359 --> 02:02.896
If you don't think you did anything wrong,

38
02:02.920 --> 02:04.320
what is there for us to talk about?

39
02:08.120 --> 02:09.120
I'm sorry.

40
02:13.800 --> 02:14.800
I'm sorry.

41
02:17.080 --> 02:18.080
I'm so sorry.

42
02:22.280 --> 02:23.280
Chen Wan.

43
02:24.439 --> 02:26.279
Could you just be a little kinder to yourself?

44
02:27.319 --> 02:28.480
I'm not mistreating myself.

45
02:28.560 --> 02:29.639
You're not?

46
02:29.719 --> 02:31.479
Then why did you leave me in the panic room?

47
02:32.439 --> 02:33.680
Stop trying to lie to me.

48
02:34.800 --> 02:35.720
Even now,

49
02:35.800 --> 02:36.959
you're still lying.

50
02:37.039 --> 02:38.719
We really have nothing left to talk about.

51
02:40.400 --> 02:42.240
You left the only way out for me.

52
02:42.800 --> 02:45.240
You forced the last of the bullets into my hands.

53
02:46.280 --> 02:49.480
You'd rather ruin things between us and sacrifice yourself just to keep me safe.

54
02:49.879 --> 02:50.879
Isn't that right?

55
02:51.560 --> 02:52.560
Chen Wan.

56
02:54.199 --> 02:55.639
You have feelings for me, don't you?

57
03:02.159 --> 03:03.319
Yes, I do.

58
03:09.439 --> 03:10.119
Even though I know

59
03:10.199 --> 03:12.639
my credibility with you is probably down to zero,

60
03:13.199 --> 03:15.079
I really don't have any ulterior motives.

61
03:15.159 --> 03:16.800
I won't bother you anymore.

62
03:17.560 --> 03:19.120
Words must be kept this time.

63
03:20.879 --> 03:23.680
Mr. Zhao, if you really don't want to see me,

64
03:24.199 --> 03:25.376
I can take another boat back—

65
03:25.400 --> 03:26.400
How will you prove it?

66
03:32.000 --> 03:33.280
I promise I'll never show up

67
03:33.360 --> 03:35.239
anywhere you might be.

68
03:35.319 --> 03:37.639
I'll delete all your contact info.

69
03:37.719 --> 03:38.799
You can have someone check

70
03:38.879 --> 03:40.119
the roadshows,

71
03:40.199 --> 03:41.000
the patents,

72
03:41.080 --> 03:42.280
the R&amp;D roster...

73
03:42.360 --> 03:43.920
You can take my name off all of them.

74
03:44.000 --> 03:45.919
If that's still not enough, Mr. Zhao,

75
03:47.280 --> 03:48.880
I can leave Haishi.

76
03:48.960 --> 03:49.960
What I'm asking is,

77
03:51.039 --> 03:52.360
if you have feelings for me,

78
03:52.960 --> 03:54.240
how are you going to prove it?

79
03:57.240 --> 03:58.240
Prove what?

80
04:00.520 --> 04:02.455
Don't tell me your feelings for me are a lie, too.

81
04:02.479 --> 04:03.040
They're not.

82
04:03.120 --> 04:04.240
Then prove it.

83
04:06.240 --> 04:07.240
I...

84
04:08.199 --> 04:09.879
I don't know how to prove it.

85
04:12.800 --> 04:14.039
Then figure it out.

86
04:15.919 --> 04:17.040
Prove it to me,

87
04:17.920 --> 04:19.399
and I'll believe you.

88
04:27.399 --> 04:28.640
I don't know.

89
04:28.720 --> 04:29.720
You don't know?

90
04:34.759 --> 04:35.759
Yes, you do.

91
04:38.079 --> 04:39.120
Think about it.

92
04:41.439 --> 04:42.560
Think hard.

93
05:40.160 --> 05:42.360
Sweeter than I imagined.

94
05:45.959 --> 05:47.679
That's the bare minimum of proof, isn't it?

95
06:02.199 --> 06:03.359
You...

96
06:03.439 --> 06:04.040
I...

97
06:04.120 --> 06:05.120
Go ahead.

98
06:09.199 --> 06:10.199
Zhao Shengge,

99
06:11.000 --> 06:12.399
can I pursue you?

100
06:14.920 --> 06:16.520
I really like you.

101
06:16.600 --> 06:18.000
Will you let me try?

102
06:19.120 --> 06:20.160
I'll treat you well.

103
06:20.800 --> 06:23.040
I'll treat you better than anyone else in the world.

104
06:25.319 --> 06:26.559
Don't worry, though.

105
06:26.639 --> 06:28.080
I won't get in your way,

106
06:28.160 --> 06:29.160
and I won't pester you.

107
06:29.240 --> 06:30.536
If you ever feel it's not working,

108
06:30.560 --> 06:31.600
I'll stop right away.

109
06:31.680 --> 06:32.680
Is that okay?

110
06:34.560 --> 06:35.319
No.

111
06:35.399 --> 06:36.399
I could never stop.

112
06:37.240 --> 06:38.639
If he likes me even a little bit,

113
06:39.240 --> 06:40.639
I'm going to want all of him.

114
06:42.399 --> 06:44.160
You must not like me that much.

115
06:45.399 --> 06:47.255
Otherwise, why did it never cross your mind to pursue me?

116
06:47.279 --> 06:47.879
That's not true.

117
06:47.959 --> 06:49.319
I like you so much.

118
06:51.360 --> 06:52.360
Zhao Shengge,

119
06:53.360 --> 06:54.800
can I pursue you?

120
06:56.959 --> 06:57.959
You can.

121
06:59.600 --> 07:01.600
But let's keep things separate.

122
07:01.680 --> 07:03.560
There's something I need to make clear first.

123
07:04.160 --> 07:06.240
I don't want any misunderstandings between us later.

124
07:09.959 --> 07:10.959
Chen Wan.

125
07:12.959 --> 07:14.319
I like you, too.

126
07:19.959 --> 07:20.959
I have feelings for you,

127
07:22.079 --> 07:23.999
even though I've never said it out loud.

128
07:24.079 --> 07:26.959
And I definitely like you more than you could ever imagine.

129
07:29.079 --> 07:30.079
But this time,

130
07:33.439 --> 07:34.759
you made me furious.

131
07:35.279 --> 07:37.399
I can't just brush it off and say it's fine.

132
07:38.680 --> 07:40.079
I can't get past it myself.

133
07:41.959 --> 07:43.759
So you'll have to try harder

134
07:43.839 --> 07:45.519
and put your whole heart into pursuing me.

135
07:46.240 --> 07:48.319
Only then will I consider saying yes.

136
07:49.879 --> 07:50.879
Understood?

137
08:34.039 --> 08:35.039
Everyone,

138
08:35.960 --> 08:37.719
I am truly sorry.

139
08:37.799 --> 08:38.520
Tomorrow,

140
08:38.600 --> 08:40.640
I will personally escort

141
08:40.720 --> 08:41.520
Mr. Zhao,

142
08:41.600 --> 08:42.319
Mr. Chen,

143
08:42.399 --> 08:43.559
and the Doctor

144
08:43.639 --> 08:44.639
on your voyage back.

145
08:45.679 --> 08:47.199
Let me offer another toast to you all.

146
08:53.360 --> 08:54.400
Don't let it happen again.

147
09:01.360 --> 09:02.360
You guys keep chatting.

148
09:03.080 --> 09:04.120
I'm going to get some air.

149
09:05.679 --> 09:06.720
Try some fruit.

150
09:07.759 --> 09:08.960
I'm already stuffed.

151
09:09.879 --> 09:10.880
Hello?

152
09:10.960 --> 09:12.079
What's up?

153
09:12.159 --> 09:13.159
Are you okay now?

154
09:13.840 --> 09:15.839
I'm fine. Recovering well.

155
09:15.919 --> 09:17.599
I'll be back in Haishi soon.

156
09:17.679 --> 09:18.679
Okay.

157
09:19.320 --> 09:20.520
That's all then.

158
09:20.600 --> 09:21.640
I'm going back to my game.

159
09:26.559 --> 09:27.600
Need something else?

160
09:28.639 --> 09:29.919
Don't you have something to ask?

161
09:30.440 --> 09:31.440
Nope.

162
09:32.000 --> 09:34.679
Heard Chen Wan locked you in the panic room, though.

163
09:35.799 --> 09:36.799
So you heard.

164
09:39.200 --> 09:40.720
Chen Wan confessed his feelings to me.

165
09:43.480 --> 09:45.440
But we aren't together yet.

166
09:46.039 --> 09:47.039
What?

167
09:47.720 --> 09:49.320
Chen Wan is pursuing me right now.

168
10:02.039 --> 10:04.840
There was such a huge security breach this time...

169
10:06.480 --> 10:07.560
I'll leave you two to talk.

170
10:08.120 --> 10:09.120
I'll excuse myself.

171
10:09.960 --> 10:10.960
Okay.

172
10:28.559 --> 10:29.559
Looking for me?

173
10:30.159 --> 10:31.159
No.

174
10:32.879 --> 10:35.000
I just came out to sober up a bit.

175
10:36.159 --> 10:37.719
Isn't there a terrace right over there?

176
10:39.799 --> 10:40.799
All right.

177
10:41.679 --> 10:43.120
I was looking for you.

178
10:43.200 --> 10:45.400
But I wasn't trying to follow you.

179
10:45.480 --> 10:48.240
I was just worried something like last time might happen again.

180
10:48.320 --> 10:49.336
If it makes you uncomfortable—

181
10:49.360 --> 10:50.360
It doesn't.

182
10:51.639 --> 10:52.639
Besides,

183
10:58.720 --> 10:59.720
Chen Wan,

184
11:01.279 --> 11:03.479
you don't need to be so polite when you're pursuing me.

185
11:06.120 --> 11:07.120
Really?

186
11:08.600 --> 11:10.280
I prefer someone who takes the initiative.

187
11:13.559 --> 11:14.600
I do take the initiative.

188
11:15.120 --> 11:16.199
Do you?

189
11:16.279 --> 11:17.639
I haven't felt it at all.

190
11:18.159 --> 11:19.440
What else do you like, then?

191
11:20.240 --> 11:21.960
Can you give me a few more hints?

192
11:30.720 --> 11:32.080
I like something more genuine.

193
11:38.600 --> 11:39.600
For instance,

194
11:41.240 --> 11:43.159
calling me whenever you want to,

195
11:44.159 --> 11:46.320
texting me any time you feel like it,

196
11:47.360 --> 11:49.159
and asking for whatever you want freely.

197
11:50.360 --> 11:51.519
That's what I like.

198
11:53.840 --> 11:54.840
Zhao Shengge,

199
11:55.360 --> 11:57.240
a lot of people must have pursued you, right?

200
11:57.320 --> 11:58.320
No.

201
11:58.360 --> 11:59.720
I don't let anyone else pursue me.

202
11:59.799 --> 12:01.279
Then why are you letting me?

203
12:02.639 --> 12:03.639
Good question.

204
12:04.519 --> 12:05.840
I'll give you the answer someday.

205
12:08.720 --> 12:10.120
Zhao Shengge.

206
12:10.200 --> 12:11.679
This feels so surreal.

207
12:12.279 --> 12:13.279
Does it?

208
12:15.120 --> 12:16.759
Then let's make it a little more real.

209
12:41.519 --> 12:42.519
Chen Wan.

210
12:44.000 --> 12:45.759
You used to treat me terribly.

211
12:47.200 --> 12:48.040
Me?

212
12:48.120 --> 12:49.280
How so?

213
12:49.360 --> 12:50.480
You know perfectly well.

214
12:51.360 --> 12:53.560
Everything you gave me before was just an afterthought.

215
12:54.639 --> 12:56.159
You seem so gentle on the surface,

216
12:57.120 --> 12:58.639
yet you have a heart of stone.

217
12:59.360 --> 13:00.600
You were never an afterthought.

218
13:01.120 --> 13:02.920
I'll treat you well.

219
13:03.000 --> 13:04.079
Very well.

220
13:04.159 --> 13:05.160
Better than anyone.

221
13:05.240 --> 13:06.240
Chen Wan.

222
13:06.960 --> 13:09.120
Actually, the things you give to everyone else,

223
13:10.080 --> 13:11.240
I don't care for them.

224
13:12.440 --> 13:15.679
I want what you can't give to anyone else.

225
13:16.879 --> 13:18.479
Whatever you want from me,

226
13:18.559 --> 13:20.320
it's yours for the taking.

227
13:22.600 --> 13:23.960
Smooth talker.

228
13:37.639 --> 13:38.639
Wait, what?

229
13:40.799 --> 13:41.799
Come again?

230
13:42.679 --> 13:43.799
Well?

231
13:43.879 --> 13:44.879
Did you do it?

232
13:46.960 --> 13:47.839
I...

233
13:47.919 --> 13:49.000
We're not together yet.

234
13:49.080 --> 13:50.200
I'm pursuing him right now.

235
13:54.200 --> 13:56.399
Must be some new way of dating.

236
13:57.000 --> 13:58.000
Back to business.

237
13:59.759 --> 14:01.255
I want to see Monica to kick the habit.

238
14:01.279 --> 14:02.679
Okay, I'll go with you.

239
14:04.080 --> 14:04.599
Then...

240
14:04.679 --> 14:06.160
Should we tell him?

241
14:06.240 --> 14:07.599
No need.

242
14:07.679 --> 14:08.679
Alright.

243
14:12.399 --> 14:13.399
Xuan.

244
14:13.919 --> 14:15.160
Why do you think it's me?

245
14:15.240 --> 14:16.559
Who else could it be?

246
14:19.080 --> 14:20.799
I keep feeling like I'm imagining things.

247
14:23.519 --> 14:24.839
You're not.

248
14:24.919 --> 14:27.799
Zhao Shengge is head over heels for you.

249
14:30.799 --> 14:32.240
Thanks, Xuan.

250
14:32.320 --> 14:34.599
Real or not,

251
14:34.679 --> 14:36.200
there's no way I'm letting him go.

252
14:37.399 --> 14:38.399
Tell you what.

253
14:38.919 --> 14:40.159
Let me give you some pointers.

254
14:40.879 --> 14:42.360
I'm practically an expert at this.

255
14:43.080 --> 14:44.760
I'll send you some stickers first.

256
14:44.840 --> 14:46.240
Use them a lot when you text.

257
14:48.000 --> 14:49.040
Got it, Xuan.

258
14:49.120 --> 14:50.120
I already have a plan.

259
14:51.759 --> 14:52.759
Come on.

260
14:54.639 --> 14:55.640
Morning and night texts.

261
14:55.720 --> 14:57.160
Picking him up and dropping him off.

262
15:15.559 --> 15:16.559
Mr. Chen.

263
15:18.360 --> 15:19.360
What is it?

264
15:20.240 --> 15:22.120
The meeting starts in five minutes.

265
15:24.360 --> 15:25.360
Viola.

266
15:25.399 --> 15:26.696
I made some extra shrimp dumplings.

267
15:26.720 --> 15:27.360
Want to try some?

268
15:27.440 --> 15:28.839
She already ate.

269
15:28.919 --> 15:29.559
Okay.

270
15:29.639 --> 15:30.639
Time for the meeting.

271
15:45.840 --> 15:47.000
Come in.

272
15:47.080 --> 15:47.799
Mr. Zhao.

273
15:47.879 --> 15:49.280
Flowers for you.

274
15:49.360 --> 15:50.360
From Keats.

275
15:51.120 --> 15:52.559
Peonies and hydrangeas.

276
15:53.919 --> 15:54.959
Should I throw them out?

277
15:55.039 --> 15:56.280
No need.

278
15:56.360 --> 15:57.360
Find a vase.

279
15:58.240 --> 15:59.400
Just leave them here for now.

280
15:59.960 --> 16:00.960
Yes, sir.

281
16:18.240 --> 16:21.000
They look great. Just like you.

282
16:23.279 --> 16:24.279
Like me?

283
16:31.159 --> 16:32.160
What's up?

284
16:32.240 --> 16:33.240
Still not done?

285
16:33.840 --> 16:34.679
Almost.

286
16:34.759 --> 16:36.000
Does your head still hurt?

287
16:36.559 --> 16:39.040
Have some hangover soup if it does.

288
16:39.120 --> 16:40.120
I only drank a little.

289
16:40.960 --> 16:42.240
That's a relief.

290
16:42.320 --> 16:43.360
I'm coming to pick you up.

291
16:44.279 --> 16:45.559
Don't bother if it's too late.

292
16:45.639 --> 16:46.639
I'll be quick.

293
17:14.440 --> 17:16.119
Why isn't Zhao Shengge out yet?

294
17:17.599 --> 17:18.599
Let's wait a bit longer.

295
17:30.839 --> 17:31.839
Where are you?

296
17:32.680 --> 17:33.880
In the underground garage.

297
17:33.960 --> 17:35.239
It's too crowded out front.

298
17:35.319 --> 17:36.359
There are paparazzi there.

299
17:38.559 --> 17:39.559
Got it.

300
17:44.319 --> 17:45.319
Where did he go?

301
17:53.039 --> 17:53.920
What are you doing?

302
17:54.000 --> 17:54.479
Hurry.

303
17:54.559 --> 17:55.920
Paparazzi over there.

304
17:56.000 --> 17:57.119
Don't let them spot you.

305
18:03.599 --> 18:04.719
Where is he?

306
18:04.799 --> 18:06.080
Where did he disappear to?

307
18:06.160 --> 18:07.519
Told you to walk faster.

308
18:09.799 --> 18:10.640
What are you doing?

309
18:10.720 --> 18:13.080
Quiet. Paparazzi.

310
18:13.160 --> 18:14.160
I...

311
18:21.599 --> 18:22.759
Get in the car.

312
18:22.839 --> 18:23.839
Take mine.

313
18:36.839 --> 18:37.839
Chen Wan.

314
18:39.759 --> 18:41.079
Why are you staring at me?

315
18:42.279 --> 18:43.279
Zhao Shengge.

316
18:43.960 --> 18:48.000
Do you have any idea how sexy you are?

317
18:48.880 --> 18:50.000
Your lips are so red.

318
18:52.440 --> 18:54.759
Weren't you quite the natural back in the cabin?

319
18:55.359 --> 18:56.640
Why so shy now?

320
19:06.440 --> 19:08.079
I've never seen you this forward before.

321
19:37.240 --> 19:38.519
Baby Chen Wan.

322
19:39.319 --> 19:40.319
Can I touch you?

323
19:41.559 --> 19:42.439
Yes.

324
19:42.519 --> 19:44.319
Even if I don't say yes to being with you?

325
19:44.880 --> 19:46.120
Even then.

326
19:46.200 --> 19:48.719
Even after we do this, I still might not say yes.

327
19:48.799 --> 19:50.039
That's fine.

328
19:50.119 --> 19:51.839
You should take your time to think it over.

329
20:09.000 --> 20:10.279
You don't have to do that.

330
20:10.359 --> 20:11.839
I've never done this for anyone else.

331
20:12.400 --> 20:13.560
Twisting my words on purpose.

332
20:15.319 --> 20:16.920
This is what I want.

333
20:17.000 --> 20:18.039
You want this?

334
20:18.119 --> 20:19.119
Yeah.

335
21:15.200 --> 21:16.200
Chen Wan.

336
21:17.960 --> 21:19.000
I didn't bring [a condom].

337
21:19.680 --> 21:20.680
I brought some.

338
21:21.480 --> 21:23.199
You brought condoms just to pick me up?

339
21:23.279 --> 21:24.519
Not just this time.

340
21:24.599 --> 21:26.400
I brought them every single time I saw you.

341
21:27.519 --> 21:28.519
You wanted it that badly?

342
21:39.720 --> 21:40.799
I didn't bring a lighter.

343
21:41.640 --> 21:42.959
Zhao Shengge.

344
21:43.039 --> 21:44.200
I want you to be happy.

345
21:45.319 --> 21:47.600
I play to win.

346
21:47.680 --> 21:49.279
I hope you're surrounded by love,

347
21:49.359 --> 21:50.400
stay in good health,

348
21:50.480 --> 21:51.480
and always win.

349
21:53.359 --> 21:54.359
Zhao Shengge.

350
21:54.920 --> 21:55.920
Chen Wan.

351
21:56.640 --> 21:57.815
You really like me, don't you?

352
21:57.839 --> 21:59.120
Zhao Shengge.

353
21:59.200 --> 22:00.200
Chen Wan.

354
22:01.119 --> 22:02.119
I like you too.

355
22:02.960 --> 22:03.960
Zhao Shengge.

356
22:10.559 --> 22:11.800
Zhao Shengge.

357
22:11.880 --> 22:14.160
The fireworks look beautiful in your eyes.

358
22:14.240 --> 22:16.599
Will you set off fireworks for me again?

359
22:17.759 --> 22:18.759
Chen Wan.

360
22:19.799 --> 22:20.799
I love you.

361
23:26.119 --> 23:27.119
Come here.

362
23:37.079 --> 23:38.079
What for?

363
23:52.480 --> 23:53.759
This lighter.

364
23:54.359 --> 23:55.480
You still kept it?

365
23:56.480 --> 23:57.480
Yeah.

366
24:50.240 --> 24:51.240
Getting up?

367
24:52.920 --> 24:56.360
We have a meeting with Dr. Fang and Mr. Xu this afternoon.

368
24:56.440 --> 24:58.120
If we get up now,

369
24:58.200 --> 24:59.200
we'll be right on time.

370
25:00.200 --> 25:01.200
Okay.

371
25:02.400 --> 25:03.400
Here.

372
25:50.200 --> 25:52.880
So the woman who took care of me at the hospital

373
25:52.960 --> 25:54.279
works for your family?

374
25:55.319 --> 25:56.160
Yeah.

375
25:56.240 --> 25:57.840
She's looked after me since I was a kid.

376
25:59.640 --> 26:00.840
Why did you

377
26:00.920 --> 26:02.759
have her take care of me back then?

378
26:03.480 --> 26:04.959
Why do you think?

379
26:05.039 --> 26:06.039
I don't know.

380
26:06.960 --> 26:07.960
Chen Wan.

381
26:08.799 --> 26:11.279
Hiring a stranger to look after you...

382
26:11.359 --> 26:12.799
I wouldn't have felt right about it.

383
26:13.920 --> 26:15.440
You're great at taking care of others,

384
26:15.519 --> 26:17.119
but terrible at taking care of yourself.

385
26:23.880 --> 26:25.199
Hold on.

386
26:25.279 --> 26:26.400
Zhao Shengge.

387
26:26.480 --> 26:28.320
Did I do well last night?

388
26:28.400 --> 26:29.400
Did you like it?

389
26:31.480 --> 26:32.480
Chen Wan.

390
26:34.279 --> 26:36.360
How do you think I did last night?

391
26:36.440 --> 26:37.599
Did you like it?

392
26:42.119 --> 26:43.119
Chen Wan.

393
26:43.839 --> 26:45.400
You're incredible.

394
26:59.039 --> 27:00.039
Time to head out.

395
27:12.119 --> 27:13.119
Chen Wan.

396
27:13.799 --> 27:16.360
Stop instinctively waiting on people.

397
27:16.440 --> 27:18.320
You're not just anyone.

398
27:18.400 --> 27:19.400
You're Zhao Shengge.

399
27:28.599 --> 27:30.119
If you keep this up,

400
27:31.200 --> 27:32.960
we're doing it again right here.

401
27:36.039 --> 27:37.039
Put on your shoes.

402
27:42.480 --> 27:43.480
Let's go.

403
27:56.200 --> 27:57.600
Chen Wan.

404
27:57.680 --> 27:58.680
What are you looking at?

405
28:02.960 --> 28:03.960
Tell me,

406
28:05.000 --> 28:06.319
after we finished last night,

407
28:06.880 --> 28:08.800
did you hear

408
28:08.880 --> 28:10.239
what I whispered in your ear?

409
28:10.319 --> 28:11.319
What did you say?

410
28:13.000 --> 28:14.240
If you didn't catch it,

411
28:14.920 --> 28:17.400
I'll just tell you again next time we do it.

412
28:25.480 --> 28:26.480
No need to get out.

413
28:28.880 --> 28:30.559
Take Mr. Chen to pick up his car.

414
28:32.920 --> 28:34.199
I'm off.

415
28:34.279 --> 28:35.039
Okay.

416
28:35.119 --> 28:36.119
Take care.

417
28:37.279 --> 28:38.279
Drive safe.

418
28:58.359 --> 28:58.880
Hello.

419
28:58.960 --> 28:59.439
Hi there.

420
28:59.519 --> 29:02.560
Could you wrap up the pink hydrangeas and peonies for me?

421
29:02.640 --> 29:03.320
Sure, no problem.

422
29:03.400 --> 29:03.920
Thank you.

423
29:04.000 --> 29:04.519
By the way,

424
29:04.599 --> 29:05.880
do you have any stationery?

425
29:05.960 --> 29:06.360
Yes, we do.

426
29:06.440 --> 29:06.880
Right this way.

427
29:06.960 --> 29:07.960
Okay.

428
29:11.039 --> 29:11.759
Take a look.

429
29:11.839 --> 29:12.839
Which one would you like?

430
29:36.559 --> 29:37.559
Chen Wan,

431
29:38.319 --> 29:39.720
you're one in a million.

432
29:48.000 --> 29:50.080
Dearest Mr. Zhao Shengge,

433
29:50.160 --> 29:51.520
I hope this letter finds you well.

434
29:52.279 --> 29:53.840
I never imagined

435
29:53.920 --> 29:54.920
that one day,

436
29:55.000 --> 29:57.400
you would actually read the letters I wrote to you.

437
30:04.319 --> 30:05.400
I don't know

438
30:05.480 --> 30:07.480
if you like this kind of confession.

439
30:08.240 --> 30:09.920
But every single day in the past,

440
30:10.000 --> 30:11.679
whenever I missed you,

441
30:11.759 --> 30:13.279
I would write you a letter.
